      "before": [
        {
          "eyebrow": "My favourite time of year",
          "heading": {
            "lead": "Amalfi,",
            "accent": "in autumn."
          },
          "paragraphs": [
            "The end of September and the beginning of October are my favourite time here. Even outside golden hour, the colours in Amalfi make me want to photograph everything, then stop and look at it all again.",
            "Nathalie and her companion had come from Finland, where it was already getting cold. They did not often have photoshoots, but here we had a beautiful town, lovely light, and a chance to remember a short Italian escape."
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "spreads",
      "eyebrow": "02 / More than photographs",
      "heading": {
        "lead": "A few days.",
        "accent": "Plenty to discover."
      },
      "frameIds": [
        "cnr1335",
        "cnr1534",
        "cnr1732",
        "cnr1820",
