        "cnr1969",
        "cnr2017",
        "cnr2034",
        "cnr2112"
      ],
      "before": [
        {
          "eyebrow": "More than photographs",
          "heading": {
            "lead": "A few days.",
            "accent": "Plenty to discover."
          },
          "paragraphs": [
            "They only had a few days in Amalfi, and I wanted them to enjoy more than our time with the camera. I shared my guide: places to visit, things to see, and restaurants I thought they would like.",
            "Knowing where to begin makes a short trip much easier. Afterwards they told me how useful those recommendations had been. I was happy that something so simple could add to their time here."
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dissolve",
      "eyebrow": "03 / The messages afterwards",
      "heading": {
        "lead": "The nicest",
        "accent": "part of the job."
      },
