      "before": [
        {
          "eyebrow": "The messages afterwards",
          "heading": {
            "lead": "The nicest",
            "accent": "part of the job."
          },
          "paragraphs": [
            "They had booked through GetYourGuide, and the messages afterwards meant a great deal to me. First came a thank-you for the time we had spent together. Then, after seeing the photographs, came the excitement about the pictures and that beautiful morning light.",
            "Nathalie was so glad she had booked the session. Seeing people enjoy their photographs and feel good about themselves is one of the nicest parts of what I do. I hope these bring a little of that morning back whenever they look at them."
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
